Common Mistakes
Using a variable before creating it

❌

print(name)

name = "Alex"

✔

name = "Alex"

print(name)
Using a keyword as a variable

❌

class = "Python"

✔

course = "Python"
Invalid variable name

❌

1name = "Alex"

✔

name1 = "Alex"
